===== Facilitating Secure IoT Communications =====
  - Collie provices a reliable network for heavy-duty IoT devices in an industrial environment, such as mass deployment of logistical drones, chemical equipment in laboratories, high-temperature manufacturing equipments, etc.
  - Collie has a built-in hardware watchdog, detecting and recovering from connection errors, enhancing network reliability.\
  - Apart from its powerful built-in firewall, Collie is also pre-installed with OpenVPN and WireGuard, supporting 30+ VPN services. By enabling VPN, Collie automatically encrypts data traffic for all devices within the network, protecting sensitive personal information and client data.
  - All of GL.iNet’s OpenWrt devices can be easily customizable using our user-friendly ImageBuilder. Users can easily optimise the OpenWrt firmware for specific use, or develop unique applications.
  - For more details, please visit [[https://www.gl-inet.com/products/gl-x300b/]]
</WRAP>

